    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>Blue Floral Porcelain Tea Set | KASODI</title>

    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Discover the Blue Floral Porcelain Tea Set by fanquare, selected by KASODI for its delicate blue floral pattern, elegant porcelain design and vintage-inspired character."
    />
  </head>

  <body>

    <Header />


    <main class="product-detail-page">

      <div class="product-breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <a href="/tableware">Tableware</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>Blue Floral Porcelain Tea Set</span>
      </div>


      <section class="product-detail-hero">

        <div class="product-detail-image">
          <img
            src="/images/tableware/blue-floral-porcelain-tea-set.png"
            alt="Blue floral porcelain tea set by fanquare styled by KASODI"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="product-detail-content">

          <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
            KASODI FIND · TABLEWARE
          </p>

          <h1>
            Blue Floral Porcelain Tea Set
          </h1>

          <p class="product-detail-brand">
            fanquare
          </p>

          <p class="product-detail-intro">
            A romantic porcelain tea set for six, decorated with delicate blue
            flowers and fine gold-tone detailing. Complete with a teapot,
            teacups and saucers, sugar bowl, milk jug and spoons, it brings the
            charm of traditional afternoon tea to an everyday table.
          </p>


          <div class="product-detail-divider"></div>


          <div class="product-detail-meta">

            <div>
              <span>Material</span>
              <strong>Fine Porcelain</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Set</span>
              <strong>Tea Set for 6</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Teapot</span>
              <strong>Approx. 860 ml</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Teacups</span>
              <strong>6 × 150 ml</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Colour</span>
              <strong>White · Powder Blue · Gold</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Includes</span>
              <strong>Teapot · Cups · Saucers · Sugar Bowl · Milk Jug · Spoons</strong>
            </div>

          </div>


          <div class="affiliate-action">

            <a
              href="https://amzn.to/4r75ni7"
              target="_blank"
              rel="nofollow sponsored"
              class="product-shop-button"
            >
              Find It Here →
            </a>

            <p class="affiliate-note">
              Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="why-we-love">

        <div class="why-we-love-label">
          KASODI NOTE
        </div>

        <div class="why-we-love-content">

          <h2>Why we love it</h2>

          <p>
            This tea set has the decorative charm of traditional floral
            porcelain without feeling too formal. The soft blue pattern,
            sculpted shapes and subtle gold-tone details give each piece a
            collected, vintage-inspired character that feels especially
            beautiful on a relaxed afternoon table.
          </p>

          <p>
            We love it for slow breakfasts, afternoon tea, cakes and small
            gatherings. The complete set makes it easy to create a considered
            table without needing every piece to match perfectly. Style it with
            natural linen, fresh flowers and simple glassware to keep the
            romantic porcelain feeling warm and contemporary.
          </p>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-care">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          CARE
        </p>

        <h2>Care for decorative porcelain</h2>

        <p>
          The product information lists the porcelain pieces as dishwasher safe
          but not suitable for microwave use. Because of the decorative
          detailing, gentle washing and careful stacking can help preserve the
          finish and keep the set looking beautiful for longer.
        </p>

      </section>


      <section class="styling-ideas">

        <div class="styling-heading">
          <p>KASODI STYLING</p>
          <h2>Style it with</h2>
        </div>


        <div class="styling-grid">

          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Natural Linen</h3>
            <p>
              Ivory, oatmeal or warm beige linen gives the delicate blue
              porcelain a softer, more relaxed backdrop.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Fresh Flowers</h3>
            <p>
              Loose garden flowers in white, blush or soft blue echo the floral
              decoration without making the table feel overly coordinated.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Warm Gold Details</h3>
            <p>
              A few warm metallic accents complement the fine decorative
              detailing and add an understated sense of occasion.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="continue-exploring">

        <div class="continue-exploring-heading">
          <p>TABLEWARE</p>
          <h2>Continue Exploring</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="continue-exploring-grid">


          <a
            href="/new-finds/fanquare-blue-floral-dessert-plates"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/new-finds/fanquare-blue-floral-dessert-plates.png"
                alt="Blue Floral Dessert Plates"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>TABLEWARE</span>
              <h3>Blue Floral Dessert Plates</h3>
              <p>fanquare</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/tableware/vintage-gold-cake-serving-set"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/tableware/vintage-gold-cake-serving-set.png"
                alt="Vintage Gold Cake Serving Set"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>TABLEWARE</span>
              <h3>Vintage Gold Cake Serving Set</h3>
              <p>XINCHEN Kitchen</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/kasodi-edit/boston-green-wine-glass"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/kasodi-edit/kasodi-edit-villeroy-boch-boston-green-glass.png"
                alt="Boston Green Wine Glass"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>GLASSWARE</span>
              <h3>Boston Green Wine Glass</h3>
              <p>Villeroy & Boch</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-final-cta">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          FANQUARE · BLUE FLORAL PORCELAIN
        </p>

        <h2>
          A little romance for the everyday tea table.
        </h2>

        <a
          href="https://amzn.to/4r75ni7"
          target="_blank"
          rel="nofollow sponsored"
          class="product-shop-button"
        >
          Find It Here →
        </a>

        <p class="affiliate-note affiliate-note-light">
          Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
        </p>

      </section>

    </main>


    <Footer />

  </body>
</html>